PKI store for pathLenConstraint chain tests (check_pki.c, suite `chain pathlen`).

Tests load the store via `SOPC_PKIProvider_CreateFromStore("./pathlen_pki_test")`
with revocation checks disabled.

## Test cases

| Test | Leaf validated | Chain (leaf to root) | Expected |
|------|----------------|----------------------|----------|
| `pathlen_pki_one_intermediate_accepted` | `leaf_ok.der` | leaf -> `ca_int_ok` -> `root_pathlen1` (pathLen 1) | OK |
| `pathlen_pki_root_pathlen0_leaf_accepted` | `leaf_ok_pathlen0.der` | leaf -> `root_pathlen0` (pathLen 0, no intermediate) | OK |
| `pathlen_pki_root_pathlen0_rejected` | `leaf_nok_pathlen0.der` | leaf -> `ca_int_from_root_pathlen0` -> `root_pathlen0` (pathLen 0) | NOK, Untrusted |
| `pathlen_pki_root_pathlen1_two_intermediates_rejected` | `leaf_nok_pathlen1.der` | leaf -> `ca_int2_ok` -> `ca_int_ok` -> `root_pathlen1` (pathLen 1) | NOK, Untrusted |
| `pathlen_pki_intermediate_pathlen0_rejected` | `leaf_nok_int_pathlen0.der` | leaf -> `ca_int_from_int_pathLen0` -> `ca_int_pathLen0` (pathLen 0) -> `root_int` | NOK, Untrusted |

Run (from `build/bin` after POST_BUILD copy):

```bash
CK_FORK=no CK_RUN_SUITE="PKI API test" CK_RUN_CASE="chain pathlen" ./check_helpers
```

## Fixture files

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| trusted/certs/root_pathlen1.der | Root pathLen 1 (cases 1 and 4) |
| issuers/certs/ca_int_ok.der | First intermediate, no pathLenConstraint |
| leaf_ok.der | Accepted leaf under root pathLen 1 |
| issuers/certs/ca_int2_ok.der | Second intermediate (case 4) |
| leaf_nok_pathlen1.der | Rejected leaf, two intermediates under root pathLen 1 |
| trusted/certs/root_pathlen0.der | Root pathLen 0 (cases 2 and 3) |
| issuers/certs/ca_int_from_root_pathlen0.der | Intermediate under root pathLen 0 (case 3) |
| leaf_ok_pathlen0.der | Accepted leaf signed directly by root pathLen 0 |
| leaf_nok_pathlen0.der | Rejected leaf, one intermediate under root pathLen 0 |
| trusted/certs/root_int.der | Root without pathLenConstraint (case 5) |
| issuers/certs/ca_int_pathLen0.der | Intermediate pathLen 0 |
| issuers/certs/ca_int_from_int_pathLen0.der | Second intermediate under pathLen 0 CA |
| leaf_nok_int_pathlen0.der | Rejected leaf, exceeds intermediate pathLen 0 |

Regeneration (requires Python 3 and the `cryptography` package):

```bash
cd tests/ClientServer/data/cert/pathlen_pki_test
python3 generate_certs.py
```
